title: Civil Liberties
subtitle: The Interior: the press, rallies and the party squads.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && PolishProjects.cardAvailable(Q, 'civil_liberties') !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card government.civil_liberties. Opening and closing the card are free; a confirmed option costs this month's action.
// Z — 0.99 (the sketch and the user's decisions of 7 XI 2026, 1A): the confiscations stop for a year; the squads of the far
// right and the communists are dissolved, the PPS Militia stays; one gain and one cost each.
PolishProjects.cardView(Q, 'civil_liberties');
// Z — 0.66 (decision 2A): the ministry of this card, on its page and as a badge in the hand.
Q.pl_gc_ministry = PolishProjects.ministryLine(Q, 'polish_gov_liberties');
!}

= Civil liberties

*[+ pl_gc_ministry +]*

The constitution guarantees the freedom of the press and of assembly, but the administration confiscates newspapers and party squads fight in the streets. Political violence stands at [+ pl_gc_violence +] of 100.

[+ pl_gc_budget +]

[+ pl_gc_projects +]

- @press_freedom
- @assembly
- @squads
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@press_freedom
title: Limit the confiscation of the press
subtitle: No cost to the budget. For a year the authorities confiscate no paper of PPS, even under a government of the right, and democracy grows stronger (+1). [? if pl_civil_liberties_press_freedom_coalition : [+ pl_civil_liberties_press_freedom_coalition +] ?]
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'civil_liberties', 'press_freedom').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_civil_liberties_press_freedom_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'civil_liberties', 'press_freedom');
!}
go-to: result

@assembly
title: Make rallies and marches easier
subtitle: No cost to the budget. The campaigns of PPS work better (+10%), but clashes in the streets become more frequent (+3). [? if pl_civil_liberties_assembly_coalition : [+ pl_civil_liberties_assembly_coalition +] ?]
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'civil_liberties', 'assembly').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_civil_liberties_assembly_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'civil_liberties', 'assembly');
!}
go-to: result

@squads
title: Dissolve the squads of the far right and the communists
subtitle: No cost to the budget. Political violence falls (−10), but our relations with the National Democrats (−5) and the communists (−10) worsen; the PPS Militia stays.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'civil_liberties', 'squads').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_civil_liberties_squads_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'civil_liberties', 'squads');
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

= Civil liberties

[+ pl_gc_result +]

- @root: Continue.
